{"id":"erfunden","lemma":"erfunden","pos":"adj","rank":1786,"glosses":["invented, contrived","fictional","imaginary"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/be/De-at-erfunden.ogg/De-at-erfunden.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wer hat das erfunden?","en":"Who invented that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391979","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe es erfunden.","en":"I made it up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/470068","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"it"},null]},{"text":"Weißt du, wer diese Maschine erfunden hat?","en":"Do you know who invented this machine?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"machine"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Seine Geschichte war erfunden.","en":"His story was made up.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"history"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"So hat er die Maschine erfunden.","en":"That's how he invented the machine.","words":[{"g":"so"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"machine"},null]}]}